# Context filter of server/Dockerfile when built from a directory (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The deploy builds from `git archive`, which already has none of these; this keeps a directory build equal.
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next*
out*
**/.local
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
.claude
docs
research_data
graphify-out
tests
**/test-results
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
